The `contours.geojson` derivative database in this directory is made available
under the Open Data Commons Open Database License (ODbL) v1.0:

https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1-0/

Attribution: Gaia DR3 (ESA/Gaia/DPAC), source density and G-band-flux HiPS
products provided by CDS/CNRS/Université de Strasbourg. Product identifiers,
release information, processing methods and checksums are in `SOURCE.md` and
the GeoJSON metadata.

Changes: NightSky Atlas generated simplified ICRS contour polygons from local
FITS cutouts of the two HiPS products. The generation procedure is documented
in `SOURCE.md` and `scripts/generate_magellanic_cloud_contours.py`.

This notice applies to the derivative contour database, not to the NightSky
Atlas PDF as a whole. The PDF is a Produced Work; see `SOURCE.md` for the
conditions and attribution to preserve when distributing it with the contours.
